From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shawn Zhang <shawn.zhang@pepperstone.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add whitelist leaf+intermediate certificate pinning

Downstream Vanadium feature: for hosts listed in the compiled-in
whitelist policy, require both leaf SPKI and an intermediate SPKI pin
(AND). Unlisted hosts are unchanged. Hooks the TLS cert verification
path in ssl_client_socket_impl (same place Chromium enforces PKP).


